<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#Sx4.SSx3.SSSx2" title="In Feature Importance Analysis Using SHAP ‣ Results and Discussion ‣ Predicting Estimated Times of Restoration for Electrical Outages Using Longitudinal Tabular Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Interpretation of SHAP Values</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
